OL,3,CArrest after suspect packages found
OL,4,Coutside MacDonalds and bars in town
OL,5,Ccentre
OL,7,FAn arrest has been made by police
OL,8,Finvestigating three suspicious
OL,9,Fpackages in Reading town centre.
OL,11,FOfficers were made aware of the first
OL,12,Flocated outside The Botanist, King
OL,13,FStreet at around 6pm on Saturday
OL,14,Fevening, July 25.
OL,16,FA second was located at around 9pm
OL,17,Flocated outside McDonald's, Friar
OL,18,FStreet and a third package near The
OL,19,FHope Tap Weatherspoons, Friar Street,
OL,20,Fat around 10.30pm.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/4
