FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785091674
OL,3,CArrest after suspect packages found
OL,4,Coutside MacDonalds and bars in town
OL,5,Ccentre
OL,7,FBomb disposal experts were initially
OL,8,Fbrought in as a precaution and the
OL,9,Fobjects were safely removed.
OL,11,FCordons have now been lifted.
OL,13,FThames Valley Police said in a
OL,14,Fstatement that an arrest had been
OL,15,Fmade, adding: "We are actively
OL,16,Finvestigating the incidents and
OL,17,Fofficers are following several lines
OL,18,Fof inquiry.
OL,26,@wD@OOU
