OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1785091674
OL,3,CArrest after suspect packages found
OL,4,Coutside MacDonalds and bars in town
OL,5,Ccentre
OL,7,F"At this moment in time, we believe
OL,8,Fthat all three incidents may be
OL,9,Flinked."
OL,11,FSuperintendent Rachel Sykes said:
OL,12,F"Additional patrols will be taking
OL,13,Fplace in the area today to provide
OL,14,Freassurance. The area is safe, but if
OL,15,Fyou have any concerns, please speak to
OL,16,Fone of our officers while they are out
OL,17,Fon patrol.
OL,26,@oD@AOUqD@HO]tD@AOU
