OL,3,CArrest after suspect packages found
OL,4,Coutside MacDonalds and bars in town
OL,5,Ccentre
OL,7,F"Thank you to those members of the
OL,8,Fpublic who contacted us and for the
OL,9,Fpatience of those who were diverted
OL,10,Ffrom the area whilst our officers
OL,11,Finvestigated these incidents."
